<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Comerci cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Comerci cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming Research said on Tuesday it cut its rating on Mexico's Controladora Comercial Mexicana SA (Comerci) to a hold from a buy.</p>
<p>Analyst Marc de Speville said Comerci was less attractive after recently ending its partnership with French retailer Auchan and buying out Kmart de Mexico SA.</p>
<p>Comerci UBC shares were up four centavos to 6.58 pesos on the Mexican bourse.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
